        {
            "_id": "AGDYcCgG4mkmvihe",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Breathe Flame",
            "sort": 1200000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The thrasfyr's serpent tail breathes a blast of flame in a @Template[type:cone|distance:50], dealing @Damage[10d12[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:40|basic] save). The thrasfyr can't Breathe Flame again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Breathe Flame]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
