        {
            "_id": "bMW69DQKTMLqLasp",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Rider's Bond",
            "sort": 1300000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The thrasfyr designates one creature as its rider by touching them with its claw. The thrasfyr and rider can communicate with each other telepathically at any range on the same plane and are aware of each other's present state, distance and direction from each other, and any conditions affecting either.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "mental",
                        "primal"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "sbPAeP8uZ3oiRj7q",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Tangling Chains",
            "sort": 1400000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The thrasfyr thrashes its chains in all directions. Each creature in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:15], except the thrasfyr's rider, takes @Damage[18d6[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:38|basic] save); a creature that fails its save is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized] until the start of the thrasfyr's next turn. The thrasfyr can't use Tangling Chains or make chain Strikes for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
